        // General rule: For the caller (address(this)) the observed approval boolean equals observedApprovalThis,
        // and every logging call must NOT revert; moreover each call's boolean return must equal observedApprovalThis.
        // This enforces that approval controls the boolean success without causing reverts.
        assert(
            observedApprovalThis == observedApproval
